{"ts": "2026-07-25T12:52:50", "level": "DEBUG", "logger": "assistant.src.orchestrator.orchestrator", "msg": "agent_name: browser\n response: {'text': '### Browser `agent` opened with pid 26728.\\n### Ran Playwright code\\n```js\\nawait page.goto(\\'https://www.pinterest.com\\');\\n```\\n### Page\\n- Page URL: https://www.pinterest.com/\\n- Page Title: Pinterest\\n- Console: 2 errors, 1 warnings\\n\\n### Snapshot\\nThe current page contains various elements. Here are some key references:\\n- `e3`: Generic element with a banner.\\n- `e4`: Banner with \"Skip to content\" link.\\n- `e8`: Skip to content button.\\n- `e10`: Navigation menu for \"Main\".\\n- `e13`: Link to \"Pinterest home\".\\n- `e32`: Link to \"Explore\".\\n- `e39`: Combobox for search.\\n- `e40`: Section with links and buttons like \"About\", \"Businesses\", \"Create\", \"News\".\\n- `e59`: Button to \"Log in\".\\n- `e63`: Button to \"Sign up\".\\n- `e80`: Join Pinterest for free button.\\n- `e82`: Text for the \"Join Pinterest for free\" button.\\n- `e84`: I already have an account link.\\n- `e103`: Heading for \"Bring your favorite ideas to life\".\\n- `e139`: Button to \"Join Pinterest\" under search by skin tone.\\n- `e263`: Textbox for email.\\n- `e269`: Textbox for password.\\n- `e307`: Continue creating your Pinterest account button.\\n- `f2e3`: Button to continue with Google.\\n\\n### Next Steps\\nThe page is already open, and we can see the login/signup options. Let\\'s proceed based on further instructions. If you want to log in or sign up, please provide more details such as credentials or specific actions.', 'status': 'success', 'status_reason': '', 'suggested_agent': None}"}
